  "instructions": [
    "Mix yautia, flour, baking powder, salt, and yeast together in a bowl.",
    "Add grated Parmesan cheese, mozzarella cheese, soy sauce, and sesame oil to the yautia mixture.",
    "Mix well to combine.",
    "Roll out the dough to a thickness of about 1/4 inch.",
    "Cut out circles of dough using a cookie cutter or the rim of a glass.",
    "Heat a skillet over medium heat and cook the bao for 2-3 minutes on each side.",
    "Once the bao are cooked, brush with soft butter and sprinkle with sesame seeds.",
    "Add a dollop of Hokkaido milk to each bao and use a spatula to create a cheese pull.",
    "Serve immediately and garnish with scallions."
  ],
